flowchart LR
  RULES[Ordered per-unit prefix configuration] --> DISPLAY[Last matching rule and one substitution]
  PHYSICAL[Canonical physical source and include instance] --> IO[Include reads and identity]
  PHYSICAL --> DEPS[Physical dependency rules and collision checks]
  PHYSICAL --> LOGICAL[Per-instance logical line filename]
  LOGICAL --> DISPLAY
  DISPLAY --> DIAG[Diagnostic and token display names]
  DISPLAY --> MACRO[FILE literal using file and macro rules]
  MACRO --> OBJECT[Original ELF data and interpreter behavior]
